ype":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は、個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うございました！(*^_^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/03/4473415/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/03/4473415/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仲良しみさみさっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/03/4473415/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々の握手にドキドキ...だったけど、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく楽しかったです(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここ最近、色んなことがあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと有難うって一人一人にお礼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来ていなかったので、しっかり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有難うって言えて良かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は、体調悪くて、座りながらでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいと言われていたけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは申し訳ないので、5部全て立って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誠心誠意、握手させて頂きました(>_<)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わざわざ遠くから会いに来てくださる方や、最近は、女の子や小さい子も"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださるようになって、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に嬉しいです（ ;  ; ）有難うございます！礼っ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不思議ですね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんなにお薬を飲んでも治らなかった腹痛が"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握